## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to architect cross-tenant secret governance, rotation, and access governance in a multi-tenant Azure environment, plus rollback strategies.

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant Key Vaults plus central SharedKV
- Managed identities for secret access
- 90-day rotation with versioning
- Azure AD B2B and access reviews
- Defender for Cloud/Monitor auditing
- Rollback and failover plans

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-code: configure 90-day rotation on SharedKV
const { SecretClient } = require("@azure/keyvault-secrets");
const { DefaultAzureCredential } = require("@azure/identity");

const credential = new DefaultAzureCredential();
const client = new SecretClient(vaultUri, credential);

// Set rotation policy
await client.setSecretRotationPolicy(secretName, {
  expiresIn: "P90D",
  notifyInDays: 7
});
```

## Why This Is Asked
Tests incident-response planning across Defender for Cloud, Azure AD, Key Vault, and cross-subscription governance.

## Key Concepts
- Automated incident response playbooks
- Key Vault secret rotation
- Managed identities and service principals
- Canary rollouts and rollback strategies
- Cross-subscription isolation and monitoring

## Code Example
```javascript
// Rotate secret using Node.js Azure SDK
const { DefaultAzureCredential } = require('@azure/identity');
const { SecretClient } = require('@azure/keyvault-secrets');
const vault = new SecretClient(`https://${'ProdKV'}.vault.azure.net`, new DefaultAzureCredential());
async function rotate(){ const newVal = require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('base64');
  await vault.setSecret('dbPassword', newVal);
}
rotate().catch(console.error);
```

## Why This Is Asked
This question tests practical control of storage exposure and integration with policy/identity controls at beginner level.

## Key Concepts
- Private endpoints
- Azure Policy deny
- Storage publicNetworkAccess flag
- Key Vault + Managed Identity
- Canary rollout and rollback

## Code Example
```javascript
{
  "properties": {
    "displayName": "Deny public network access on storage accounts",
    "policyRule": {
      "if": {
        "allOf": [
          {"field": "type", "equals": "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts"},
          {"field": "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/publicNetworkAccess", "equals": "Enabled"}
        ]
      },
      "then": {"effect": "Deny"}
    }
  }
}
```

